    "bio": {
      "zh": "主要研究方向为人工智能、知识工程等。曾承担多项国家、省、市级科研项目的研发工作，相关成果已形成系列高水平学术论文，在国际顶级会议和高水平期刊发表，申请国家发明专利 8 项，获得软件著作权 6 项，具有丰富的科研工作经验。",
      "en": "Research interests include artificial intelligence and knowledge engineering. Has undertaken research and development for multiple national, provincial, and municipal projects, with findings published at leading international conferences and in high-quality journals. Has applied for eight Chinese invention patents and obtained six software copyrights, with extensive research experience."
    },
